# Workflow and manuscript layout reference
# These paths are documented here as a local-artifact manifest only.
# Uncomment entries later if you want them to become active ignore rules.

# Local OS noise
# Thumbs.db
# Desktop.ini

# Python cache and bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd

# Local secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Repo-level workflow roots
# AGENTS.md
# .agents/
# .codex/
# sources/

# Core workflow state
# docs/current_status.md
# docs/research_gates.md
# docs/workflow_state_machine.md

# Phase 1 to Phase 3 agent artifacts
# docs/agent/

# Phase 4 to Phase 5 manuscript roots
# paper/AGENTS.md
# paper/agent/

# Style bootstrap materials
# paper/style/
